```

And in `frame_get_lazychunk`, for the in-memory case (`frame->cframe != NULL`), `*needs_free` stays `false`. But for the special value case (`offset < 0`), `frame_special_chunk` is called which sets `*needs_free = true` and allocates `*chunk = malloc(32)`.

